WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.850
Jamie jumps toward and over Chun-Li’s position.

2
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:01.450
Chun-Li’s downward medium-kick stomp intercepts Jamie.

3
00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:02.550
One hit of jumping medium punch follows the stomp.

4
00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:04.300
After landing, Chun-Li uses heavy Tensho Kicks.

5
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:04.900
Both characters recover after the Tensho ender.
